{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2017-08", "window": 1, "start_date": 1501545600, "end_date": 1502150399, "month_true_total": 613, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:07:12 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "34091931", "author": {"steamid": "76561198048475587", "personaname": "frederic2ec", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/frederic2ec/", "num_games_owned": 366, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 30491, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 24011, "last_played": 1753846153, "avatar": "2a521b3b25833b2933477b320ca2edeb689dd720"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very good games\n\nEDIT :\nArma 3 is one of my favorites game in my library, I had the best moment in my life on it, I'm still impressed that the developer still get more content after all this years, but sadly all these thing that made Arma 3 popular and good in my eye are gone but for a good reason I think. Would I recommend the game in 2020 ? Yes and no, if you want to play the only gamemode available and popular yes, but if you want to play the mode that made the game so popular then no. I'm still keeping my review positive tho.", "timestamp_created": 1502149541, "timestamp_updated": 1602732241, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.54356849193572998", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 29, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "34091550", "author": {"steamid": "76561198145034109", "personaname": "IGS Karma", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/igskarma/", "num_games_owned": 145, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 588827, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 139230, "last_played": 1706425699, "avatar": "54be3