nOnly bad thing is the lag in multiplayer.\nYou have to have a decent PC  and good internet for great experience.", "timestamp_created": 1502134632, "timestamp_updated": 1502134632, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "34087911", "author": {"steamid": "76561198027060856", "personaname": "Hunter404", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/hunter404/", "num_games_owned": 499, "num_reviews": 109, "playtime_forever": 59164, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 49691, "last_played": 1604860154, "avatar": "6af20c150f016b14d2c4a3d77c52e7e1c7d94588"}, "language": "english", "review": "The very best \"milsim\" there is, all gamemodes, mods, maps etc make up for an almost inifnitely replayable game. Has some issues with FPS even on monster rigs, but it's pretty easy to overlook becuase of the beuty of the game.\n\nStill has some issues with cheaters (skiddies) who will do their very best to ruin your fun, but otherwise the multiplayer experience is 10/10.", "timestamp_created": 1502133451, "timestamp_updated": 1502133451, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}]}